5,1,1,talk,Mio,,"Since we're finally updating how we split the bills, I want to make sure we don't end up feeling guilty for using the heat. I'll look into the kitchen notice about the cooler and sunlight and heating need by room.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I need to understand the actual costs over a full year and the potential setup fees. I'll check the last twelve utility statements and the electrician's quote for the rooms.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to see how much work it is to actually manage the money! I'll check the monthly settle observed at another house and the trial run of a reconciliation template.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I want to know if some of us are actually paying more than others. I'll look into the plug-in monitor readings room by room and the payment log for the last twelve months.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I want to see how the payment process has affected us. I'll look into the payment log for the last twelve months and settling up when the last rooms filled.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,Does anyone else think we should check how other houses handle this? Maybe we can find a way that doesn't make us feel like we're being watched every time we turn on a light.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"That is a valid point, but we should prioritize the hard data first. I am more concerned with the financial volatility of our current system than the social atmosphere.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji, but the social atmosphere is what makes it a home! If we're all stressed about the money, the hard data won't make us any happier.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, while I appreciate the sentiment, sentiment doesn't pay the gas bill. We need to determine if the current distribution is actually fair before we worry about the vibes.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I agree that fairness is important, but we should also consider how the process of calculating that fairness affects our relationships.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,"I guess we all agree that fairness and the atmosphere are both important. Since we've already picked our lists, let's see what we find and then figure out a balance.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,Agreed. Let us proceed with the research so we have a factual basis for the discussion. I will stick to my chosen items.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,Me too! I'm excited to see if those templates actually make things easier or if they're just more homework for us.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'll stick with my choices as well. I'm curious to see if the monitor readings prove that some of us are living in luxury while others freeze.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I'll stick with mine too. I hope looking at the past payment issues helps us avoid the same mistakes in the future.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,"Since we're all set, let's just wrap this up and go check our things. I'll see you all back here soon to share what we've found!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will do the same. Let us reconvene once we have all reviewed the information.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,I'm on it! I'll go find those templates and see how they work. See you all in a bit!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I'll be back shortly. Let's hope the data gives us a clear answer so we can stop guessing.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I'll go look into the logs now. See you all soon.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
